---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Tyler Zarzuela | Game Developer & Software Engineer</title>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-emerald-500 selection:text-slate-950">
		
		<!-- NAVIGATION -->
		<nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md bg-slate-950/80 border-b border-slate-800/80">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
				<span class="font-bold text-lg tracking-wider text-emerald-400">CZ.DEV</span>
				<div class="flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
					<a href="#projects" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Projects</a>
					<a href="#experience" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Experience</a>
					<a href="#skills" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Skills</a>
					<a href="#contact" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Contact</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- HERO SECTION -->
		<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 flex flex-col items-start gap-6">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">
				<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
				GAME DEVELOPER & SOFTWARE ENGINEER
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
				Tyler Zarzuela Amor <br />
				<span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-cyan-400">
					Building Immersive Gameplay & Systems
				</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-400 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
				Passionate game developer with a strong technical foundation in game engines, level integration, C++, and AI. Experienced in cross-platform systems, VR interactions, and agile team environments.
			</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
				<a href="#projects" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20">
					View Featured Projects
				</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/tyzarzuela" target="_blank" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 text-slate-200 font-semibold transition-all">
					GitHub Profile
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FEATURED PROJECTS SECTION -->
		<section id="projects" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-800/60">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Key Coursework & Research Projects</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-400 mb-10">Highlighting engine development, AI integrations, and technical mechanics.</p>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				
				<!-- Project 1: Bachelor Thesis -->
				<div class="group bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
					<div class="aspect-video bg-slate-800/80 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 font-mono text-sm border-b border-slate-800">
						[ VR Gameplay / LLM Demo GIF ]
					</div>
					<div class="p-6">
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3 flex-wrap">
							<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 text-xs font-medium">Unreal Engine 5</span>
							<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-medium">VR / Meta Quest</span>
							<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-medium">LLM / Blueprints</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">VR Interaction System Using LLMs</h3>
						<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
							Bachelor Thesis project. Developed an UE5 VR game prototype where all in-game interactions are dynamically generated by open-source LLMs integrated via Blueprints. Analyzed UX feedback dynamics and prompt responses.
						</p>
						<div class="flex gap-4 text-xs font-semibold">
							<a href="https://github.com/tyzarzuela" target="_blank" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">Repository →</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Project 2: Custom Engine EDEN -->
				<div class="group bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
					<div class="aspect-video bg-slate-800/80 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 font-mono text-sm border-b border-slate-800">
						[ Engine Architecture / Render GIF ]
					</div>
					<div class="p-6">
						<div class="flex gap-2 mb-3 flex-wrap">
							<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 text-xs font-medium">C++</span>
							<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-medium">Engine Architecture</span>
							<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 text-xs font-medium">ECS</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">EDEN - Custom Game Engine</h3>
						<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
							Built a 2D/3D game engine from scratch in C++. Engineered core systems including graphics rendering, physics simulation, collision detection, input management, and a modular Entity-Component System (ECS).
						</p>
						<div class="flex gap-4 text-xs font-semibold">
							<a href="https://github.com/tyzarzuela" target="_blank" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">Repository →</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- EXPERIENCE & EDUCATION SECTION -->
		<section id="experience" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-800/60">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Work Experience & Education</h2>
			
			<div class="space-y-8">
				<!-- Work Experience -->
				<div class="bg-slate-900/40 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between mb-2">
						<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">Game Development Intern <span class="text-slate-400">@ NowAR Lab</span></h3>
						<span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">2025</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
						<li>Integrated real-time weather systems in Unity using external weather APIs.</li>
						<li>Optimized dynamic lighting and environmental effects using advanced baked lightmaps techniques.</li>
						<li>Collaborated in an agile, multidisciplinary team alongside designers, 3D artists, and senior developers.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<!-- Education -->
				<div class="bg-slate-900/40 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between mb-2">
						<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-400">Bachelor's Degree in Video Game Development <span class="text-slate-400">@ UCM</span></h3>
						<span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">2021 - 2025</span>
					</div>
					<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-2">Universidad Complutense de Madrid (Expected Graduation: 06/2025)</p>
					<ul class="text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
						<li>Member of the Mentoring Club: Guided junior students through academic engineering milestones.</li>
						<li>Active participant in competitive coding challenges and Game Jams.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- SKILLS SECTION -->
		<section id="skills" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-800/60">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Technical Stack</h2>
			
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
					<h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-3">Programming Languages</h3>
					<ul class="text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-2">
						<li>• C++ / C# / C</li>
						<li>• Python / Java / JavaScript</li>
						<li>• Software Architecture</li>
						<li>• Data Structures & Systems</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
					<h3 class="text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-3">Engines & Platforms</h3>
					<ul class="text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-2">
						<li>• Unreal Engine 5 (Blueprints/C++)</li>
						<li>• Unity Engine / Godot</li>
						<li>• PS5 & Android Development</li>
						<li>• Meta Quest / VR Systems</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800">
					<h3 class="text-purple-400 font-bold mb-3">Tools & Multimedia</h3>
					<ul class="text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-2">
						<li>• Git / Version Control</li>
						<li>• Visual Studio / VS Code</li>
						<li>• Blender (3D Blockout & Models)</li>
						<li>• FMOD / Reaper (Audio Systems)</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- FOOTER / CONTACT -->
		<footer id="contact" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-800/60 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 text-center">
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-200">Let's Connect</h3>
			<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md">Open to Game Development, Gameplay Programming, and Technical Level Design roles.</p>
			
			<div class="flex gap-6 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400">
				<a href="mailto:czarzuelamor@gmail.com" class="hover:underline">czarzuelamor@gmail.com</a>
				<a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" class="hover:underline">LinkedIn</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/tyzarzuela" target="_blank" class="hover:underline">GitHub</a>
			</div>

			<p class="text-slate-600 text-xs mt-6">© 2026 Tyler Zarzuela Amor. Built with Astro & Tailwind CSS.</p>
		</footer>

	</body>
</html>